# Cursor IDE Rules for LinkDeck

## 🔴 BEFORE EXECUTING ANY PROMPT

### Step 1: For ANY code changes (always)
Read `docs/CODING-GUIDELINE.md` - imports, naming, conventions

### Step 2: Based on task type
| Task Type | Also Read |
|-----------|-----------|
| Tests | `docs/TESTING.md` |
| UI/UX/Visual | `docs/DESIGN.md` |
| Features/Structure | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |

---

## ⛔ CRITICAL RULES (Cannot Skip)

### Tests: One File at a Time
1. Modify ONE test file
2. Run checks (from root, in order):
   - `pnpm lint`
   - `pnpm format`
   - `pnpm check-types`
3. Run test (from app/package dir):
   - `cd apps/web && pnpm test path/to/file.test.ts`
4. Fix any issues → Only then next file

**NEVER batch-edit test files.**

---

